# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# TEMPLATE FILE — safe to commit. Contains no real secrets.
#
#   cp .env.example .env      then fill in .env (which IS gitignored)
#
# For this course you probably need NOTHING in here. You're logged in
# through your Claude subscription (`claude auth status`), and the SDK
# inherits that credential automatically. See Module 01.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# OPTIONAL — only if you switch off subscription auth to a metered API key.
# Get one at https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys
# WARNING: setting this OVERRIDES your subscription login and bills per token.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-your-key-here

# OPTIONAL — Module 06, when you connect the GitHub MCP server.
# Create a fine-grained token with read-only repo scope:
# https://github.com/settings/tokens
# GITHUB_TOKEN=ghp_your_token_here

# OPTIONAL — Module 07, used by the weather MCP server you'll build.
# The lesson works without a key (it uses a keyless public API by default).
# WEATHER_API_KEY=your_key_here
